{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "bcbb93b6-a288-4ee7-9765-59d1b3d41fa2",
    "name": "Book My Visa",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "All Book My Visa API routes, grouped by service. Run the whole collection top to bottom (Runner) for the full flow, or send single requests.\n\n## Before running\n1. Start everything from the repo root: `docker compose up --build` (see README.md). Notification needs the Gmail login in `backend/.env`.\n2. Set the collection variable `testEmail` to an inbox you own. The flow sends REAL email to it (a \"new slots open\" alert and a booking confirmation).\n\n## Flow\n1. **Auth Service** (:4000): create and log in a test user, update the profile, then log in as the seeded admin and try the admin routes.\n2. **Notification Service** (:4003): the test user subscribes to Schengen / Student slot alerts.\n3. **Booking Service** (:4001): the admin creates a slot (Notification emails the subscriber), the test user books it (Notification emails a confirmation).\n4. **Cleanup**: unsubscribe and log out.\n\nTokens and ids are saved into collection variables automatically (`userToken`, `adminToken`, `targetUserId`, `bookingId`).\n\nNotes: signup accepts 409 when the test user already exists. Slot alerts are limited to one per person per country and visa type every 24 h (`SLOT_ALERT_COOLDOWN_HOURS`), so a rerun may not send a second alert. Logout only revokes the token at Auth; Booking and Notification check tokens locally until they expire."
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth Service",
      "description": "Signup, login, profile and admin routes. Base URL: {{authBaseUrl}}",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/health",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Auth is healthy', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ok'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Metrics",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/metrics"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Prometheus metrics are available', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "User",
          "description": "A normal user signs up and manages their profile.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Sign up test user",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "prerequest",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "const email = pm.collectionVariables.get('testEmail');",
                      "if (!email || email === 'you@example.com') { throw new Error('Set collection variable testEmail to an inbox you own before running; Notification sends real email.'); }"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Account is created or already exists', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201, 409]); });",
                      "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                      "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                      "  pm.collectionVariables.set('targetUserId', body.user.id);",
                      "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userToken', body.accessToken);",
                      "}"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{testEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{testPassword}}\",\n  \"fullName\": \"{{testFullName}}\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/signup",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "noauth"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Log in as test user",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Test user login succeeds', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                      "const body = pm.response.json();",
                      "pm.collectionVariables.set('userToken', body.accessToken);",
                      "pm.collectionVariables.set('targetUserId', body.user.id);"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{testEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{testPassword}}\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/login",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "noauth"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Get current user",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/me",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{userToken}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Current user matches the test account', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); pm.expect(pm.response.json().user.email).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('testEmail')); });"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Update profile",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"mobile\": \"+353 87 123 4567\",\n  \"nationality\": \"Irish\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/me",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{userToken}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Profile is updated', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); const user = pm.response.json().user; pm.expect(user.nationality).to.eql('Irish'); pm.expect(user.mobile).to.eql('+353 87 123 4567'); });"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin",
          "description": "Logs in as the seeded admin (admin@example.com / Password123) and manages the test user.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Log in as admin",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/login",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "noauth"
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Seeded admin login succeeds', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); pm.expect(pm.response.json().user.role).to.eql('admin'); });",
                      "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', pm.response.json().accessToken);"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "List users",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/admin/users?role=user&page=1&limit=20",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Admin can list users', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); pm.expect(pm.response.json().data).to.be.an('array'); });"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "List audit logs",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/admin/logs?page=1&limit=20",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Admin can list audit logs', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); pm.expect(pm.response.json().data).to.be.an('array'); });"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Change user role",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"user\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/role",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Admin role update succeeds', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); pm.expect(pm.response.json().user.role).to.eql('user'); });"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Disable user",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"isActive\": false\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/status",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Admin can disable the test user', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); pm.expect(pm.response.json().user.isActive).to.eql(false); });"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Enable user",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"isActive\": true\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/status",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Test user is re-enabled', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); pm.expect(pm.response.json().user.isActive).to.eql(true); });"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Log in test user again (role/status changes end old sessions)",
              "description": "Admin role/status changes invalidate existing Auth tokens. Refresh the user token before the final logout.",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{testEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{testPassword}}\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/login",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "noauth"
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Re-enabled test user can log in', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                      "pm.collectionVariables.set('userToken', pm.response.json().accessToken);"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Notification Service",
      "description": "Health, metrics and \"tell me when slots open\" subscriptions. Emails themselves are triggered by Booking (folder 3). Base URL: {{notificationBaseUrl}}",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health (database and RabbitMQ)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{notificationBaseUrl}}/health",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Notification and dependencies are healthy', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); const body = pm.response.json(); pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('ok'); pm.expect(body.database).to.eql('ok'); pm.expect(body.rabbitmq).to.eql('ok'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Metrics",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{notificationBaseUrl}}/metrics",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Prometheus metrics are available', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('notification_'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Subscribe to Schengen / Student alerts",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": "{{notificationBaseUrl}}/subscriptions/Schengen/Student",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{userToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Subscription is created or refreshed', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); const sub = pm.response.json().subscription; pm.expect(sub.country).to.eql('Schengen'); pm.expect(sub.visaType).to.eql('Student'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List my subscriptions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{notificationBaseUrl}}/subscriptions",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{userToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('My subscription is listed', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); const data = pm.response.json().data; pm.expect(data.some((item) => item.country === 'Schengen' && item.visaType === 'Student')).to.eql(true); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Reject unknown country",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": "{{notificationBaseUrl}}/subscriptions/Atlantis/Student",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{userToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Unsupported choice returns validation error', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(400); pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('VALIDATION_ERROR'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Booking Service",
      "description": "Slots (admin) and bookings (user). Creating a slot and booking it each send a RabbitMQ message that Notification turns into an email. Base URL: {{bookingBaseUrl}}",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{bookingBaseUrl}}/health",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Booking is healthy', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ok'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Metrics",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "url": "{{bookingBaseUrl}}/metrics"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Prometheus metrics are available', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Slots",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Admin: create slot (emails subscribers)",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "prerequest",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "const day = new Date();",
                      "day.setUTCDate(day.getUTCDate() + 31 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 365));",
                      "pm.collectionVariables.set('slotDay', day.toISOString().slice(0, 10));",
                      "const startMinutes = Math.floor(Math.random() * 92) * 15;",
                      "const endMinutes = startMinutes + 15;",
                      "const fmt = (minutes) => `${String(Math.floor(minutes / 60)).padStart(2, '0')}:${String(minutes % 60).padStart(2, '0')}`;",
                      "pm.collectionVariables.set('slotTime', `${fmt(startMinutes)} - ${fmt(endMinutes)}`);"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Admin creates a future slot', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                      "pm.collectionVariables.set('bookingId', pm.response.json().slot.bookingId);"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"country\": \"Schengen\",\n  \"visaType\": \"Student\",\n  \"day\": \"{{slotDay}}\",\n  \"slotTime\": \"{{slotTime}}\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": "{{bookingBaseUrl}}/api/v1/tpv/slots",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Admin: reject duplicate slot",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"country\": \"Schengen\",\n  \"visaType\": \"Student\",\n  \"day\": \"{{slotDay}}\",\n  \"slotTime\": \"{{slotTime}}\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": "{{bookingBaseUrl}}/api/v1/tpv/slots"
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Duplicate slot is rejected', function () {",
                      "  pm.response.to.have.status(409);",
                      "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('DUPLICATE_SLOT');",
                      "});"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "List available slots",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{bookingBaseUrl}}/api/v1/tpv/slots?country=Schengen&visaType=Student&day={{slotDay}}",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "noauth"
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('New slot appears in available slots', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); const data = pm.response.json().data; pm.expect(data.some((slot) => slot.bookingId === pm.collectionVariables.get('bookingId'))).to.eql(true); });"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Bookings",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Book the slot (emails a confirmation)",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"bookingId\": \"{{bookingId}}\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": "{{bookingBaseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{userToken}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Booking is confirmed', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); pm.expect(pm.response.json().appointment.bookingId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('bookingId')); });"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "List my bookings",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{bookingBaseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/my-slots",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{userToken}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('My appointments include the new slot', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); const data = pm.response.json().data; pm.expect(data.some((appointment) => appointment.bookingId === pm.collectionVariables.get('bookingId') && appointment.slot.isBooked)).to.eql(true); });"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Check the slot is no longer available",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{bookingBaseUrl}}/api/v1/tpv/slots?country=Schengen&visaType=Student&day={{slotDay}}",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "noauth"
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Booked slot is absent from available slots', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); const data = pm.response.json().data; pm.expect(data.some((slot) => slot.bookingId === pm.collectionVariables.get('bookingId'))).to.eql(false); });"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Reject booking the same slot twice",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"bookingId\": \"{{bookingId}}\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": "{{bookingBaseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings",
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{userToken}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Already-booked slot is rejected', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(409); pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('SLOT_UNAVAILABLE'); });"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Cleanup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Notification: unsubscribe",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{notificationBaseUrl}}/subscriptions/Schengen/Student",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{userToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Subscription is removed', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(204); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Auth: log out",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/logout",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{userToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Logout succeeds', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(204); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
